Here is a responsive HTML and CSS landing page template for a travel agency:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cosmic Travels - Explore the Universe</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a2e 0%, #1a1a4e 100%);
            color: #e0e0e0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 4em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #fff; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.3em; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .cta-button {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: #8ab4f8;
            color: #0a0a2e;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .cta-button:hover { transform: scale(1.05); background: #a8c8ff; }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 80px 40px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-card h3 { color: #8ab4f8; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #666;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5em; }
            .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 40px 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Explore the Cosmos</h1>
        <p>Embark on the journey of a lifetime. From orbital hotels to lunar resorts, discover the universe with our expert guides.</p>
        <a href="#" class="cta-button">Start Your Journey</a>
    </section>
    <section class="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Space Hotels</h3>
            <p>Luxury accommodations in low Earth orbit with panoramic views of our planet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Lunar Adventures</h3>
            <p>Walk on the Moon with our certified guides. Experience low-gravity thrills.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Mars Expeditions</h3>
            <p>Be among the first to set foot on the Red Planet. Limited availability.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Cosmic Travels. The final frontier awaits.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
```

Customize the title, text, colors, and images to match your specific travel agency brand.

Here is a responsive HTML page template for a Cyberpunk Cafe menu with a neon-on-black theme:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cyberpunk Cafe</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; background: #0a0a0a; color: #00ff00; min-height: 100vh; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 40px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #00ff00; }
        header h1 { font-size: 3em; color: #ff00ff; text-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff00ff; }
        header p { color: #00ffff; }
        .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; padding: 40px 0; }
        .menu-item { background: #111; border: 1px solid #00ff00; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .menu-item:hover { border-color: #ff00ff; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,0,255,0.3); transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .menu-item h3 { color: #00ffff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .menu-item .price { color: #ff00ff; font-size: 1.2em; }
        .menu-item p { color: #00ff00; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 5px; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { header h1 { font-size: 2em; } .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header><h1>CYBERPUNK CAFE</h1><p>Neon Nights / Digital Bites</p></header>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-item"><h3>Quantum Brew</h3><div class="price">$5.99</div><p>House blend infused with nitrogen, served cold</p></div>
            <div class="menu-item"><h3>Hacker's Delight</h3><div class="price">$8.99</div><p>Double espresso with a hint of vanilla syrup</p></div>
            <div class="menu-item"><h3>Neon Noodles</h3><div class="price">$12.99</div><p>Ramen in a glowing broth with bio-luminescent toppings</p></div>
            <div class="menu-item"><h3>Digital Donuts</h3><div class="price">$6.99</div><p>Glazed donuts with an edible LED light center</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

Customize the colors, text, and items. The neon color scheme uses cyan (#00ffff), magenta (#ff00ff), and green (#00ff00) on black.
